(7760651, 1285308, 141319, '<td valign="top">The concept is lovely. The statue is skew, not sure how I feel about the texture you used, I understand you wanted to give an ethereal feel but it creates the white blodges around the rosary which to me are distracting</td>', 'The concept is lovely. The statue is skew, not sure how I feel about the texture you used, I understand you wanted to give an ethereal feel but it creates the white blodges around the rosary which to me are distracting', '2023-12-04 01:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760652, 1285475, 141319, '<td valign="top">I think a slightly different composition (less on top) would have made this a stronger image.</td>', 'I think a slightly different composition (less on top) would have made this a stronger image.', '2023-12-04 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
